# ==============================================================================
# MedKeep - 严格个人隐私与医疗档案保护规则 (Privacy & Medical Records Guard)
# 警告：任何真实就医单据、影像图片、结构化数据均不得提交至公共代码仓库！
# ==============================================================================

# 1. 真实医疗单据与扫描图片 (All Real Medical Receipts, Scans, & PDFs)
records/*
!records/.gitkeep
!records/demo/
!records/demo/**
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
*.heif
*.pdf
*.tiff
*.bmp
!records/demo/**/*.jpg
!records/demo/**/*.jpeg
!records/demo/**/*.png
# 允许 viewer / UI 静态图标资源 (若有)
!viewer/assets/**
!viewer/*.svg
!viewer/*.png

# 2. 真实医疗结构化数据 (Real Medical Records JSONL & Markdown Archives)
*.jsonl
data/*.jsonl
!data/*.template.jsonl
!data/*.sample.jsonl
data/*-episodes.json
data/*-conditions.json
*.bak
*病历*.md
*档案*.md
*报告*.md
!docs/**

# 3. 私有配置文件 (Private Configuration with real names/credentials)
config/medkeep.json
!config/medkeep.template.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*

# 4. 临时归档、收件箱与草稿 (Scratch, Inbox, and Temporary Staging)
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
inbox/
_inbox/
.inbox/
.legacy/

# 5. Python 运行时输出 (Python Runtime Outputs)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# 6. 操作系统与编辑器临时文件 (OS & Editor Cache)
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
